        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions  CF2002P Contemporary Rope Style Refrigerator Door Pull.</b>\r\n<p>Fitted with smooth 90 degree radius ends, for a twist on the center Rope Tube, for a Contemporary looking Refrigerator Door Pull.  Elegance from the simple design make this rope style appliance pull a very popular choice when dressing up freezers and refrigerators.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Also available: <a href=\"/products/contemporary-rope-door-pull-fii-2002p\"><b>Contemporary Rope Entry Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel. All though this Appliance Pull is available in several lengths, we believe a refrigerator needs to have a 18\" or longer pull installed to  effectively pull open todays large \"vacuum\" sealed doors such as the ones found on a Sub Zero refrigerator. \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions CF2002P Contemporary Rope Refrigerator Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 10</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CF2002P-detail-picture.jpg?v=1718159556\" target=\"new\"><b>First Impressions CF2002P Detailed Picture</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 different standard lengths.</b>\r\n<li>FII-CF2002P12: Total Length 12\", Center to Center Mount: 11-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CF2002P18: Total Length 18\" , Center to Center Mount: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CF2002P24: Total Length 24\" , Center to Center Mount: 23\"</li>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This appliance handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese Refrigerator pulls are supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4\" - 1\" thick panels (standard appliance panel thickness).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
